  "notes": [
    "import_spec.tz is NOT a LiveImportSpec field (SPEC 5.7.1 says 'account tz given by --tz' but neither LiveImportSpec nor the CLI table defines it): SPEC gap. Expected rows assume America/New_York.",
    "dateTime 'yyyyMMdd;HHmmss' local (no offset). 2026-10-15 is EDT (UTC-4); 2026-11-02 is EST (UTC-5, DST ended 2026-11-01). ts_precision s.",
    "ibCommission is negative for a cost ('-0.3') -> canonical fee +0.3. SPEC's table does not state this sign flip (SPEC gap).",
    "quantity is signed (-50 for SELL); canonical qty is unsigned, side from buySell. UNVERIFIED in IBKR's own reference; matches ibflex/et handling.",
    "account comes from accountId because import_spec.account is null; order_key uses it.",
    "No order quantity, limit price or TIF in an execution row: orig_qty = sum of executions, limit_px null, tif other, order_type from orderType (LMT -> limit). Flex shows only orders that executed, so never-filled orders are absent (scoring bias, SPEC gap).",
    "orderReference (daily single-day queries only) -> client_order_id when present.",
    "Fill rows have no leaves_qty (unknown)."
